{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "cfdf6778480393b5a721d42cf705268bc490b37f29be4fdde2ef0b430ee9fa02", "ja": "いよいよ、映画『おとぎの国の物語』が\nクランクイン。衣装やセットの影響もあり、\nアイドル達は練習の時よりも更にいい演技を\nみせる。撮影を見守るプロデューサーは、\n今回の映画の成功を確信する。", "zh": "电影《童话王国的故事》正式开镜。\n有了服装和布景的加持，\n偶像们秀出比练习时更加精湛的演技。\n制作人从旁关注着拍摄过程，\n坚信这次电影将会获得成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8fcbdcc734538086a15117f9864044f0a46ea73df3efddb5a57b96bad44c2081", "ja": "（映画『おとぎの国の物語』がいよいよクランクイン\n……みんなには、練習の成果を発揮してもらおう！）", "zh": "（电影《童话王国的故事》终于正式开镜了……\n希望大家务必发挥练习的成果！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8cd768a5b48f5668cd6d6fa0fdc97646d1ce490c6ab98db89b342cc2b16935d8", "ja": "（まずは、少女がお城で働く姉のところから帰る途中、\n森の中で迷子になってしまうシーンだ……）", "zh": "（首先是少女离开在城堡工作的姊姊家，\n于回家途中在森林里迷路的场景……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "ceb65475ba60642c77c1b1a6e71185245eaac39ad8244e06e5564f4ec70ac17a", "ja": "あれ？　なんだか見たことのない景色……。\nもしかしてわたし、道を間違えちゃった……？", "zh": "奇怪？这片景色好陌生……\n我该不会走错路了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "ec0dd647f488796769698ef7e2926970d57477acfcec073140dffffb7b123de4", "ja": "ど、どうしよう……帰り道が、\nわからなくなっちゃいました……うぅ……。", "zh": "怎、怎么办……\n不知道回家的路要怎么走了……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "061b7b13014b9ae976662c8f4d7ebb94f45c4ac0011e9c880072c7ae768438f1", "ja": "お、お母さぁん……お姉ちゃん……ぐすっ。", "zh": "妈、妈妈……姊姊……呜呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1005_se", "source_sha256": "14c468c82099cb5a701b0e8229c722719a6ca26f0e37f00f015878f3d89eae31", "ja": "ガサガサッ", "zh": "（沙沙作响）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "2778c04876d17093c91b26911a9583d0fa39b8e4d3d96c2ec28961c781702fd2", "ja": "きゃっ！？\n……そ、そこにいるのは、誰？", "zh": "呀！？\n……是、是谁在那里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "b6de9c6f18e9f9e07682710ebdf37eccd5091ebe8d0548e9250f9ca0157c8488", "ja": "ん？　……わぁ！？\nににに、人間っ！！？", "zh": "嗯？……哇啊！？\n人人人人类！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "8873ec190dbb1171cd29ba68b7f36fe6375dbf416946f4abcf3984c5a05a8264", "ja": "どどど、どうしてこんなところに人間がいるんだ！？\nうう、困ったぞ……！", "zh": "为为为为什么这种地方会出现人类！？\n唔唔，伤脑筋了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "cae9f1cffb2444a9f25aac4791849270d79c4fc81b16503c2e5d939c31674e3c", "ja": "あの～。わたし、道に迷ってしまったみたいなんです。\n森の向こうの村に行く道を、知りませんか……？", "zh": "请问～我好像迷路了，\n你知道要怎么走，才能到森林对面的村庄吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "9e1a3c481ceca09ab9939d8ad73b7badd7157b70dd291a829d9e22b4547941fc", "ja": "えっ、迷子なの！？　大丈夫！？", "zh": "咦，你迷路了！？没事吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "36737b9f787ab12973b3d471546e99c38453d1b20a0982a6b9f923d4eb6f1844", "ja": "あっ！　耳に、尻尾……。もしかしてあなたは、\n森に住んでるっていうオオカミさんですか？", "zh": "啊！耳朵和尾巴……\n难不成你就是住在森林里的大野狼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "2490614a1901236405379461b4707ca978c33d6c7489546ecac5bd3eeabae76c", "ja": "ぎくっ！？　じ、自分はオオカミなんて\n名前じゃないぞ！　ビッキーだ！", "zh": "呃！？本、本人的名字不是大野狼喔！\n是毕奇！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "429b1082bbb00803fcf6d1c4fadd563169acdd1ae6c3fcd643b3f3e597d28347", "ja": "ビッキーさん……そうですか、はじめまして！\nわたしは、リカっていいます！", "zh": "毕奇……这样啊，初次见面，你好！\n我叫莉卡！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "dcaf8f51b113104b14202f908bb411401684923a7b3d3f49b2f1379dc0e5b4d3", "ja": "あ、はじめまして……って、うぎゃー！\nそうじゃなくて！", "zh": "啊，幸会……呃，呜呀──！\n不是啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "c87daad8eca43ab07cfa7a925311e77d025945c885a394d9f993e1a6b2d4943c", "ja": "ううっ……人間と話すの久しぶりでキンチョーが……。\nだ、だいじょーぶ……怖くない、怖くない……。", "zh": "呜呜……好久没跟人类说话了，好紧张……\n没、没事的……不怕不怕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "48070d1c8361123092fc1ee1874a50a7c7781ed75f9a8d28e81d4d33302327f8", "ja": "に、人間なんか、ちっとも怖くないぞー！", "zh": "本、本人一点也不怕人类喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "029c0bafd556c118a1ad2e0e511e49cb53ef82c49890d4e8d00a74bbd745ff40", "ja": "……？\nビッキーさんは、人間がこわいんですか？", "zh": "……？\n毕奇会怕人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "72f219e02ddc6b6280f7bd051008a200a52dad282b2df684b980267663770f5d", "ja": "えぇ！？　なんでわかったの！？", "zh": "咦咦！？你怎么知道！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1019_p", "source_sha256": "67d00877f874d29cfa77fe169840bcf7cd4e26498c9f9db70a97bedfdbfd1959", "ja": "（その頃、妖精のモモと一緒にいたのは、ステラと\n名乗る人物だった。どうやら記憶がないらしい……）", "zh": "（同一时间，与妖精莫莫待在一起的，\n是一名自称史黛拉的人物，他似乎丧失了记忆……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "e430868a98313ac9d83ec95097af694d6e13129434507ddebb0ca3a6216234ea", "ja": "もうちょっとで、なんか思い出せそうなんだよなー。\nうう……頭がモヤモヤする……。", "zh": "只差一点好像就能想起什么了……\n唔唔……脑袋一片模糊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1021_049mom", "source_sha256": "7f099a52dd292d3767c5dae749e077c6c2a38b26420a6b434741ad88fc959b8a", "ja": "大丈夫！　魔法使いマリーのところに行けば、\nきっとステラの記憶も戻るよ！", "zh": "没关系！只要去魔法使玛莉那里，\n你一定就能恢复记忆！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "71063241170df5ec6d7083df7f377622deb8e0d0bf3114dc3382f3130e51db0f", "ja": "魔法使い、マリー……？\nモモ、それって誰のこと？", "zh": "魔法使玛莉……？\n莫莫，那是谁？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "4d61d9bc7b33a90c02554b87bd6d795a46c9921e96c92a22c591725e9c54c318", "ja": "『偉大なる魔法使い』は、どんな悩みも\n必ず解決しちゃうっていう、スゴイ人だよ！", "zh": "『伟大魔法使』是很厉害的人，\n无论什么烦恼，她必定都能解决喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1024_049mom", "source_sha256": "8e09289758ddc16cd5805235d0b22bfdd160e1af2723b6c6b8577adeb448ca40", "ja": "森の奥に住んでいて、いつもお茶会をしてる、\nちょっと変わっ……ううん、あの、いい人だよ！", "zh": "她住在森林深处，总是在办茶会，\n人有点奇……不对，呃，她人很好喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1025_047sub", "source_sha256": "cd478485c21b6d5e5c69e2a22e6d88824ebacb36a7322aa8060b6ce7112b897d", "ja": "へえ～。じゃあその、『偉大なる魔法使い』ってのに\n会えば、オレの記憶も元に戻るのかな？", "zh": "是喔～那见到那位『伟大魔法使』，\n我的记忆也会复原吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "7a9e8cde486d7463770871c73257c94416b435b2e19c1c784beadf787a8d28ce", "ja": "う、うん！　たぶん、きっとそう！\n私が、魔法使いのところまで案内してあげる！", "zh": "唔、嗯！应该是那样没错！\n我来带领你去魔法使那里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1027_047sub", "source_sha256": "22e2a76e70f4f506eace89167f2aa079de5bc87c15b87a708a423b3cbac5926f", "ja": "マジで！？　助かった～！\nそうと決まれば、さっそく森の奥に行かなくちゃな！", "zh": "真的吗！？得救了～！\n既然决定了，就得赶紧往森林深处出发！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1028_049mom", "source_sha256": "ca20527db84af88fa65aa9201961f2b688fd16bc6c0123d14725b7034663ee09", "ja": "着る物を用意したから、さっそく着替えて！\nその服だと、旅をするには目立っちゃうでしょ？", "zh": "我有准备衣服，快点换上吧！\n不然穿着那套服装旅行会很引人注目。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1029_047sub", "source_sha256": "3f2ddeacab45b847b9c2589a8f7cf65853fb75b2b90c9662a56c8120c748ed75", "ja": "おっと、それもそうだな。\nモモ、いろいろサンキュな♪", "zh": "哎呀，说得也是。\n莫莫，谢谢你帮了我这么多♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1030_049mom", "source_sha256": "a3119e44adcfdd5ad649e7dbf8f9f1b7cbd62a52005c60be48f6e5343d8eeae8", "ja": "あっ……ううん！　どういたしまして！", "zh": "啊……没有啦！不用客气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1031_p", "source_sha256": "19bd44aea5da15b722bedfdd55a988fb6806dbd6c2608f253c761ea48bd1878c", "ja": "（そして、とある場所ではアヤシイ魔法使いが……）", "zh": "（而在某处，有一位可疑的魔法使……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_05_1032_021mat", "source_sha256": "a78ed5f94dc21574864553039b26096c5a71194379da366f88e75e8749a3cae0", "ja": "材料は……砕いた蛇の牙、乾燥したワニの皮、\nピンクのユニコーンの角、スズランの花びら……。", "zh": "材料有……打碎的蛇牙、晒干的鳄鱼皮、\n粉红独角兽之角、铃兰的花瓣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
